     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p><span data-math=\"2 \\times {3^2}-5 \\times 8\"></span></p>\n<p>Use PEMDAS.</p>\n<table class=\"unnumbered unstyled\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Evaluate the exponent.</td>\n<td><span data-math=\"2 \\times 9-5 \\times 8\"></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Multiply by 9.</td>\n<td><span data-math=\"18-5 \\times 8\"></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Multiply by 8.</td>\n<td><span data-math=\"18-40\"></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Subtract.</td>\n<td><span data-math=\"-22\"></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>"
    },
